{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"setEmails:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"NSArray","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSArray"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"emails"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Array of email address strings. Each must be a valid email format.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"emails"}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Associates multiple email addresses with the current device for omnichannel"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"email campaigns. This is useful when users have multiple email addresses"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"(work, personal, etc.) and want to receive communications on all of them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All provided emails will be linked to the same device and user ID,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enabling unified targeting across all addresses."}]},{"anchor":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Register multiple emails from user profile:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["class UserProfileManager {","","    func syncEmailsFromProfile(_ profile: UserProfile) {","        var emails: [String] = []","","        if let primary = profile.primaryEmail {","            emails.append(primary)","        }","        if let secondary = profile.secondaryEmail {","            emails.append(secondary)","        }","        if let work = profile.workEmail {","            emails.append(work)","        }","","        guard !emails.isEmpty else { return }","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setEmails(emails)","","        \/\/ Update tags with email count","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"email_count\": emails.count,","            \"has_work_email\": profile.workEmail != nil,","            \"has_multiple_emails\": emails.count > 1","        ])","    }","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setEmails:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers multiple email addresses associated with the current user."}],"metadata":{"title":"setEmails:","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setEmails:"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setEmails:","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Method","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setEmails:"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setemails:"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","title":"PushwooshCore","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"role":"collection"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setEmails:":{"abstract":[{"text":"Registers multiple email addresses associated with the current user.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/